Different files in this repository may be available under different
licenses, following section 7 of the Space Grade Linux Technical Charter
(CHARTER.md).

Documentation in this repository, including RFCs, is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (charter section
7.b.iv). See LICENSE.CC-BY-4.0 for the license text.

Code in this repository, if any, is licensed under the MIT License, the
Project License (charter sections 7.b.i and 7.b.iii). See LICENSE.MIT for
the license text.

The TSC may approve an alternative license for a contribution on an
exception basis (charter section 7.c).

CHARTER.md reproduces the Technical Charter of Space Grade Linux a Series
of LF Projects, LLC, for reference.

Individual files contain an SPDX tag instead of the full license text to
identify their license (charter section 7.d). For example, the following
tag indicates that the CC-BY-4.0 license applies to the containing file:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0

SPDX License Identifiers are listed at https://spdx.org/licenses/
